OL,3,GNEWSAFacebook seller mis-sold me an
OL,4,Aunsafe horse that kicked my daughter in
OL,5,Athe head
OL,6,
OL,7,FWhen her teenage daughter was lying
OL,8,Fmotionless on the floor after being
OL,9,Fkicked in the head by a horse, Fiona
OL,10,Ffeared the worst.
OL,12,F"For a moment, I thought she was dead,"
OL,13,Fshe said. "I thought she had broken her
OL,14,Fneck."
OL,16,FThe horse Fiona bought six weeks
OL,17,Fearlier via Facebook was marketed as a
OL,18,F"teenager's dream" but during a riding
OL,19,Flesson, it bucked and bolted with her
OL,20,Fdaughter partially on it before kicking
OL,21,Fher in the head.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
