OL,3,GNEWSAFacebook seller mis-sold me an
OL,4,Aunsafe horse that kicked my daughter in
OL,5,Athe head
OL,6,
OL,7,FNow Fiona, whose name has been changed
OL,8,Fto protect her daughter's identity, is
OL,9,Fone of five women who have told the BBC
OL,10,Fthey were mis-sold horses that were
OL,11,Feither unsafe to ride or had
OL,12,Flife-limiting conditions by horse
OL,13,Fseller Tasha Lee Hopkins.
